    "DemandMap": {
      "additionalProperties": true,
      "description": "Stage 1.4 rolled up. The keyword rows themselves live in\n`ResearchReport.priced_keyword_list` \u2014 they are the CSV export, so they are\nheld once, at the top level, rather than duplicated inside a section.",
